<title>POLAND: POLL - POLISH ZLOTY SEEN AT 3.6868 VS DLR END-97.</title>
<headline>POLL - POLISH ZLOTY SEEN AT 3.6868 VS DLR END-97.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish zloty is seen easing against the dollar by year end, and the prediction is more pessimistic than last month, according to a Reuter poll of the country's 27 largest banks.</p>
<p>On Monday the zloty was fixed at 3.4730 to the dollar.</p>
<p>		   AUGUST	 END-97	   12-MONTHS AHEAD</p>
<p> USD/PLN AVG   3.5166    3.6868 (3.4743)   3.9290 (3.6420)</p>
<p>     MINIMUM   3.4400    3.4800 (3.3500)   3.6400 (3.4000)</p>
<p>     MAXIMUM   3.5570    3.9500 (3.6108)   4.4100 (4.0351)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets, previous figures for end-97 and July-98 from last month's poll.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
